ESPNEW
function setup {
ESpindesk
clear white
txt 0 0 4 "initializing" black
loop 56 {
draw square x 240 10 black
add x 9
pause 0
}
set x 0
loop 24 {
draw square x 240 10 green
add x 20
pause 100
}
clear black
add initOK 1
}
function loop {
if osver < 12000 then txt 0 0 3 "device must be updated" red

if osver > 11990 then txt 0 0 3 "device is updated" green

if osver > 11990 {
box test 150 150 50 50 green
txt 150 150 1 "exit" black
if test > 0 {
clear green
pause 1000
clear black
espexit
}
}
else {
box test 150 150 50 50 red
txt 150 150 1 "exit" black
if test > 0 {
clear red
pause 1000
clear black
espexit
}
}

note{
version: 1.4
author: wave o.s developer
this is a test app to check the newly implemented
'espnew' command
you can find this exact app on the wave surfer app
REQUIREMENTS: 
wave o.s 11 version 11.100 or greater
also stay tuned for wave o.s 
with the new implamented 'espexit' command

}
}
